Z||000000||FieroRoos||10-01-1999||11:15 PM||||My temperature gage is not working.  I think that the gage is ok and that it may be the sensor.  I purchased a new sensor from Checker and now am having a problem locating it on the engine block.  I have heard that the engine has three temp. sensors.  One for the gage, one for the computer, and one for the fan.  I also heard that all three are located on the block next to the thermostat.  I can only find two there and neither of the two match the part I got at Checkers.  So......I figure that (1) I got the wrong part or (2) I am looking in the wrong place.  Any suggestions??  It is a 86 SE V6.<p>[This message has been edited by FieroRoos (edited 10-01-1999).]||||reg||1
